      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-301147",
      ":question/problem": "There are $80$ students in the school science club. A random sample of science club students was conducted, and each participant was asked if they planned to participate in the upcoming regional competition. Of those surveyed, $35%$ responded that they plan to participate.\n\nBased on this survey, which of the following is the best estimate of the total number of science club students who plan to participate?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
